{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Four Keeps 把 iPhone 變成隨身四格照相館，適合與朋友聚會、派對或旅行時即場拍下四格相條留念，亦可匯入手機內已有的四張照片重新排版。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-61.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>四格相條隨手拍</h2>\n<p>以 iPhone 前後鏡頭拍攝四張計時照片，可選 3 秒、5 秒或 8 秒倒數，或從相簿匯入四張照片。內置十二款菲林風格與八種紙張顏色，支援裁剪、旋轉、鏡像及重新排序，並可加上說明文字與日期。完成後可輸出高解析度 JPEG 或列印用 PDF，尺寸可選 2 × 6 吋相條、4 × 6 吋雙格與 4 × 5 吋明信片。拍攝與編輯均在裝置上完成，無需帳戶，不含廣告或訂閱。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-57-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-58-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-59-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-60-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-61-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-62-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Four Keeps: Photo Booth</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/four-keeps-photo-booth/id6826418647?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T06:45:47.524349+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:26:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:53.962031+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:38:48.368290+00:00","content_hash":"0da26764bb37afc17e91c572847a5e0f5e7a93c59c74ace8897146a910f090fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}